        "lrc": "[00:00.000] 作词 : James Horner/Will Jennings/Nick Vestuto\n[00:01.000] 作曲 : James Horner\n[00:18.800]Every night in my dreams\n[00:22.800]I see you, I feel you\n[00:27.800]That is how I know you go on.\n[00:37.800]Far across the distance\n[00:41.800]and spaces between us\n[00:47.800]You have come to show you go on.\n[00:55.800]\n[00:56.800]Near, far, wherever you are\n[01:05.800]I believe that the heart does go on\n[01:16.800]Once more, you opened the door\n[01:24.800]And you're here in my heart,\n[01:29.800]and my heart will go on and on.\n[01:44.800]\n[01:45.800]Love can touch us one time\n[01:50.800]and last for a lifetime\n[01:55.800]And never let go till we've gone.\n[02:05.800]Love was when I loved you,\n[02:09.800]one true time I hold to\n[02:15.800]In my life we'll always go on.\n[02:23.800]\n[02:26.900]Near, far, wherever you are\n[02:35.900]I believe that the heart does go on\n[02:46.900]Once more, you opened the door\n[02:54.900]And you're here in my heart,\n[02:59.900]and my heart will go on and on.\n[03:23.900]\n[03:24.900]You're here, there's nothing I fear\n[03:32.900]And I know that my heart will go on.\n[03:44.900]We'll stay, forever this way\n[03:52.900]You are safe in my heart\n[03:57.900]and my heart will go on and on.\n[04:19.900]\n"
